  "slug": "wedding-planning-incident-report-form",
  "title": "Wedding Planning Incident Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Record a wedding-planning or event-day disruption as facts, preserve relevant evidence, route urgent decisions, and close corrective actions.",
  "description": "An original incident record for schedule, supplier, service, property, guest-experience, access, or plan-control failures during wedding delivery. It separates observed facts from conclusions and routes safety, privacy, authority contact, compensation, and liability decisions to responsible roles.",
  "use_case": "Use when an event lead must document a material departure from the approved wedding plan or an event-day incident. Address immediate needs first, record only necessary facts, preserve referenced evidence, and close only after qualified review and corrective-action handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
